    "redirects": [],
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Noun\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Noun</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Adjective\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Adjective</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Derived_terms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Derived terms</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;經濟\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"經濟\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from <i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F#Vietnamese\" title=\"經濟\">經濟</a></i>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Japanese language\">Japanese</a></span> <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B5%8C%E6%B8%88#Japanese\" title=\"経済\">経済</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">keizai</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, re-purposed from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Chinese\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle Chinese\">Middle Chinese</a></span> <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"ltc\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F#Middle_Chinese\" title=\"經濟\">經濟</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"ltc-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">keng tsejH</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from the phrase <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B6%93%E4%B8%96%E6%BF%9F%E6%B0%91#Chinese\" title=\"經世濟民\">經世濟民</a></i><span class=\"Zsym mention\" style=\"font-size:100%;\">&#160;/ </span><i class=\"Hans mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%96%E6%B5%8E%E6%B0%91#Chinese\" title=\"经世济民\">经世济民</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"zh-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">kinh thế tế dân</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to fix the world and help the common folks</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, which is usually translated as <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\">trị đời giúp dân</i>. <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\">Kinh tế</i> was also used in some archaic texts as short for <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%B6%93%E9%82%A6%E6%BF%9F%E4%B8%96&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"經邦濟世 (page does not exist)\">經邦濟世</a></i><span class=\"Zsym mention\" style=\"font-size:100%;\">&#160;/ </span><i class=\"Hans mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%BB%8F%E9%82%A6%E6%B5%8E%E4%B8%96&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"经邦济世 (page does not exist)\">经邦济世</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"zh-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">kinh bang tế thế</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to fix the state and help the world</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. The meaning of this Chinese compound vaguely resembles that of <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Greek\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Ancient Greek\">Ancient Greek</a></span> <i class=\"Polyt mention\" lang=\"grc\"><a href=\"/wiki/%CE%BF%E1%BC%B0%CE%BA%CE%BF%CE%BD%CE%BF%CE%BC%CE%AF%CE%B1#Ancient_Greek\" title=\"οἰκονομία\">οἰκονομῐ́ᾱ</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"grc-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">oikonomĭ́ā</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">household management</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from which the modern concept of \"economy\" derives, which is why Japanese scholars chose it as a translation.\n</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kïŋ˧˧ te˧˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Huế\">Huế</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kɨn˧˧ tej˨˩˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kɨn˧˧ tej˦˥]</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh\">kinh</a> <a href=\"/wiki/t%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"tế\">tế</a></strong></span> (<i>classifier</i> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%E1%BB%81n#Vietnamese\" title=\"nền\">nền</a></span>)&#32;\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/economy\" title=\"economy\">economy</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Adjective\">Adjective</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh\">kinh</a> <a href=\"/wiki/t%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"tế\">tế</a></strong></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/economic\" title=\"economic\">economic</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Derived_terms\">Derived terms</h3></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-switcher\" data-toggle-category=\"derived terms\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg ul-column-count\" data-column-count=\"3\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91%E1%BA%B7c_khu_kinh_t%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"đặc khu kinh tế\">đặc khu kinh tế</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/special\" title=\"special\">special</a> <a href=\"/wiki/economic\" title=\"economic\">economic</a> <a href=\"/wiki/zone\" title=\"zone\">zone</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh_t%E1%BA%BF_h%E1%BB%8Dc#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh tế học\">kinh tế học</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"vi-Latn\" class=\"tr Latn\"><span class=\"Hani\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E5%AD%B8#Vietnamese\" title=\"經濟學\">經濟學</a></span></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/economics\" title=\"economics\">economics</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh_t%E1%BA%BF_s%E1%BB%91#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh tế số\">kinh tế số</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh_t%E1%BA%BF_tu%E1%BA%A7n_ho%C3%A0n#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh tế tuần hoàn\">kinh tế tuần hoàn</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/kinh_t%E1%BA%BF_x%C3%A3_h%E1%BB%99i#Vietnamese\" title=\"kinh tế xã hội\">kinh tế xã hội</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/socioeconomics\" title=\"socioeconomics\">socioeconomics</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/t%C4%83ng_tr%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Fng_kinh_t%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"tăng trưởng kinh tế\">tăng trưởng kinh tế</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/v%C3%B9ng_%C4%91%E1%BA%B7c_quy%E1%BB%81n_kinh_t%E1%BA%BF#Vietnamese\" title=\"vùng đặc quyền kinh tế\">vùng đặc quyền kinh tế</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
    "wikitext": "==Vietnamese==\n\n===Etymology===\n{{vi-etym-sino|經濟}}, from {{bor|vi|ja|経済|tr=keizai}}, re-purposed from {{der|vi|ltc|經濟|tr=keng tsejH}}, from the phrase {{m|zh|經世濟民|tr=kinh thế tế dân||to fix the world and help the common folks}}, which is usually translated as {{m|vi||trị đời giúp dân}}. {{m|vi||Kinh tế}} was also used in some archaic texts as short for {{m|zh|經邦濟世|tr=kinh bang tế thế||to fix the state and help the world}}. The meaning of this Chinese compound vaguely resembles that of {{der|vi|grc|οἰκονομῐ́ᾱ||household management}}, from which the modern concept of \"economy\" derives, which is why Japanese scholars chose it as a translation.\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n\n===Noun===\n{{vi-noun|cls=nền}}\n\n# [[economy]]\n\n===Adjective===\n{{vi-adj}}\n\n# [[economic]]\n\n===Derived terms===\n{{col3|vi\n|{{vi-l|đặc khu kinh tế||[[special]] [[economic]] [[zone]]}}\n|{{vi-l|kinh tế học|經濟學|[[economics]]}}\n|{{vi-l|kinh tế xã hội||[[socioeconomics]]}}\n|tăng trưởng kinh tế\n|vùng đặc quyền kinh tế\n|kinh tế tuần hoàn\n|kinh tế số\n}}\n\n{{C|vi|Economics}}"
  }
}
